<title>USA: US Treasuries end nearly flat ahead of refunding.</title>
<headline>US Treasuries end nearly flat ahead of refunding.</headline>
<text>
<p>*T-bond recoups most lost ground, positions squared for auction</p>
<p>*Decent bill sale helps. The 3-,6-mth bills came in at 5.14</p>
<p>pct and 5.37 pct with no tails and high bid-to-cover ratios.</p>
<p>*Supply worries dominate ahead of 3-, 10-yr auctions.</p>
<p>*Bonds get late support from near 143-point Dow surge.</p>
</text>
